---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Render a JSON report as json, junit, markdown, html or sarif

Usage: rustman report render [OPTIONS] --format <FORMAT> <REPORT>

Arguments:
  <REPORT>
          The JSON report (from `rustman run --reporter json` or `rustman explore run`)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: json, junit, markdown, html or sarif

  -o, --output <FILE>
          Write to this file instead of stdout

      --fail-on <SEVERITY>
          JUnit fails operations with findings at or above this severity (default: the exploration's --fail-on)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
